    trustNote: "Rated for a far longer service life than typical straw filters",
    url: AMZ("B01CWFR92M", "sawyer"),
    ctaLabel: "View on Amazon",
    pros: [
      "Exceptional rated filter lifespan, well beyond the rest of this list",
