      "Cleaned by swishing rather than backflushing with a syringe",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Shorter rated filter life than the others here",
      "Costs more than the straw-style options",
      "The soft flask is the weak point over years in storage",
    ],
  },
  {
    rank: 5,
    name: "Grayl GeoPress Purifier Bottle",
    brand: "Grayl GeoPress",
    score: 8.1,
